`tr_ssprint_iter1` (18 sites + call 1, back to `0xe950`) `.seq`
`tr_ssprint_iter2` (18 sites + call 2, to `0xe99c`) `.seq`
`tr_ssprint_tail` (12 sites, to `ret`).

Sites are the generated `Vsa/Sim/SsprintSites.lean` battery
